Third-party components
======================

- fheroes2 1.1.17, copyright the fheroes2 Resurrection team, GNU GPL
  version 2 or later (engine/fheroes2.js, engine/fheroes2.wasm and
  engine/fheroes2.data, compiled unmodified with the project's own
  Emscripten build, Makefile.emscripten, by tools/build-fheroes2.mjs in
  https://github.com/RobertPKyle/frunk-store; license text in
  engine/LICENSE; the complete source in
  engine/fheroes2-1.1.17-src.tar.gz). From https://github.com/ihhub/fheroes2
  at commit 2685c2188b541660f1ce261b554c3e92f79b1775. The build includes
  SDL2 (zlib license), SDL2_mixer (zlib license, with its MIDI, MP3 and Ogg
  Vorbis decoders) and zlib (zlib license), from Emscripten's ports, and
  libsmacker (GNU LGPL 2.1 or later), which comes with fheroes2's source.
  engine/fheroes2.data holds fheroes2's own files: its data file,
  translations, maps and the Timidity instruments for MIDI music, as
  found in its source.

The game's own files (Heroes of Might and Magic II) aren't part of this
app: players load them from a copy they own. Heroes of Might and Magic is
a trademark of Ubisoft Entertainment.
